    "claim": "Always fill out the desc field when writing a command, adding a control, or substantially altering a library. desc is discovery: MCP tools/list omits blank-desc commands entirely, and agents find controls through desc. upsert_command cannot set a desc, so creation must be followed by set_command_meta.",
    "tags": "doctrine,desc,discovery,workflow,code",
    "source": {
      "doc": "the owner, in session, 2026-08-05"
    },
    "confidence": "high",
